<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00480">
	<title>Forward Collision-Avoidance Assist malfunction</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>forward collision-avoidance assist (FCA) (sensor fusion) 
					<indexterm>forward collision-avoidance assist malfunction</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e03624">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e03625">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/OOV055180L.eps" align="center" height="1.740in" placement="break" id="e03626"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<ol outputclass="callout" id="e03627">
								<li>
									<p> <uicontrol>Check driver assistance system.</uicontrol> </p>
								</li>
							</ol>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>When Forward Collision-Avoidance Assist is not working properly, the warning message will appear, and the yellow (<image align="left" height="0.117in" href="../../images/WKIA_037.eps" outputclass="nolabel" placement="inline" width="0.143in" scale="15" id="e03628"/>), (<image href="../../images/WKIA_077.eps" align="left" placement="inline" height="0.118in" width="0.170in" outputclass="nolabel" scale="15" id="e03629"/>) and (<image align="left" height="0.117in" href="../../images/WKIA_040.eps" outputclass="nolabel" placement="inline" width="0.117in" scale="15" id="e03630"/>) warning lights will appear on the cluster. Have your vehicle inspected by a professional workshop. Kia recommends visiting an authorized Kia dealer or service partner.</p>
	</conbody>
</concept>